# 默认按文本处理，但 GitHub 语言统计要能认出这是 Python 项目
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py    text diff=python
*.md    text diff=markdown
*.json  text
*.jsonl text
*.txt   text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text
*.toml  text
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.sh    text eol=lf

# 二进制：不要让 Git 尝试做行尾转换或 diff
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gguf  binary
*.index binary

# 评测产物与样例文档算「生成物」，不参与语言统计
runs/** linguist-generated
data/demo/** linguist-generated
